The '''Paladin's Letter''' is provided as an objective for {{questlong|Alliance|1|Paladin's Letter (quest)|Paladin's Letter|race=HighElf|class=paladin}}.

==Contains==
{{Book|content=
<name>, I am known as Lor'thas the Holy. I was once part of the Order of the Silver Hand.

Before the fall of the Order and the Kingdom of Lordaeron I was known as a paladin, a valiant servant of the light, banishing darkness wherever it may be. Your path is taking you down one that is similar to mine. You carry the will of the Light alongside great martial prowess.

Seek me out in the lodge and I shall train you to the best of my ability.
}}

